WEBVTT

00:00.880 --> 00:05.520
Rather than wait for death better to take the initiative prepare troops, exit the city.

00:05.680 --> 00:07.080
Yes.

00:26.400 --> 00:28.480
General General.

00:28.560 --> 00:31.600
General's calculations are flawless they've left the city.

00:32.960 --> 00:37.480
Brothers mount up I'll lead you to take the city today.

00:37.560 --> 00:38.720
Yes.

00:50.000 --> 01:08.000
With just a single charge, the ranks of two thousand soldiers were pierced through by iron cavalry. The Yiyang Army retreated in panic as Shi Lang pursued relentlessly, reaping heads like mowing wheat.

